{"unit_id": "wyinthe__dsh-qq#feature-1", "repo": "wyinthe/dsh-qq", "commit": "77a1a878a680d65ee62f42fb51db8e62baf045fe", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-qq 的功能「双向私聊文字」：QQ 白名单用户发来的文本会投递到 DSH agent；该轮会话回复通过 OneBot11 私聊发送回 QQ。桌面发起的轮次不会回推。 通过 QQ 私聊消息或回复正文中的对应标记触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:376-400"]}
{"unit_id": "wyinthe__dsh-qq#feature-2", "repo": "wyinthe/dsh-qq", "commit": "77a1a878a680d65ee62f42fb51db8e62baf045fe", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-qq 的功能「图片收发」：收到的 QQ 图片会下载到临时目录，并把本地路径交给会话；回复中的 `[[img:路径]]` 标记会读取本机图片并以 base64 图片段发送。 通过 QQ 私聊消息或回复正文中的对应标记触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:279-302"]}
{"unit_id": "wyinthe__dsh-qq#feature-3", "repo": "wyinthe/dsh-qq", "commit": "77a1a878a680d65ee62f42fb51db8e62baf045fe", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-qq 的功能「QQ 表情收发」：入站表情转成会话文本标记，回复中的 `[[face:编号]]` 或 `[[mface:emoji_id/package_id/名字]]` 会转换成 QQ 表情消息段。通过 QQ 消息或回复标记触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:304-363"]}
{"unit_id": "wyinthe__dsh-qq#feature-4", "repo": "wyinthe/dsh-qq", "commit": "77a1a878a680d65ee62f42fb51db8e62baf045fe", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-qq 的功能「语音转写」：收到语音时插件从 NapCat 获取 WAV，并在配置 earScript 后调用本地脚本；脚本输出转写文本及可选的 `[语气]` 行后投递给会话。 通过 QQ 私聊消息或回复正文中的对应标记触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:117-149"]}
{"unit_id": "wyinthe__dsh-qq#feature-5", "repo": "wyinthe/dsh-qq", "commit": "77a1a878a680d65ee62f42fb51db8e62baf045fe", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-qq 的功能「会话复用或创建」：配置 sessionId 时复用指定会话；未配置时首次收到消息会创建会话并保存状态，后续消息继续使用该会话。 通过 QQ 私聊消息或回复正文中的对应标记触发。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:152-195"]}
{"unit_id": "wyinthe__dsh-qq#caveat-1", "repo": "wyinthe/dsh-qq", "commit": "77a1a878a680d65ee62f42fb51db8e62baf045fe", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-qq 使用前须知：收到的图片和语音文件会写入配置的临时目录；插件另将会话状态保存到 stateDir，默认位于 DSH_HOME/qq。（见 index.js:31-34）", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:31-34"]}
{"unit_id": "wyinthe__dsh-qq#caveat-2", "repo": "wyinthe/dsh-qq", "commit": "77a1a878a680d65ee62f42fb51db8e62baf045fe", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-qq 使用前须知：需连接 NapCat 的 OneBot11 WebSocket，私聊仅接受 owners 列表中的号码；语音转写需用户自备脚本，插件不内置 ASR。（见 index.js:19-30）", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:19-30"]}
